==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Luxio|45}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.
*'''Electric Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Shinx|91}} and {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Luxio|92}}, both from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

